AMENDEDANALYSIS
This bill extends the office of the right-to-know ombudsman, complaint process, appeal and
enforcement, and rulemaking for 2 years, and exempts a person who assists a petitioner with a
right-to-knowcomplaintatnochargefromtheunauthorizedpracticeoflaw.

